ents reproduce exactly."}, {"id": "agents_append_only_ledger", "label": "Append-Only Multi-Unit Ledger", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "C:\\Users\\Sobhan\\OneDrive\\Documents\\gold project prd\\AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ledger entries are never updated or deleted; correction is a new document and a deferred database constraint enforces zero balance in each dimension per transaction."}, {"id": "agents_event_rate_snapshot", "label": "Event Rate Snapshot", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "C:\\Users\\Sobhan\\OneDrive\\Documents\\gold project prd\\AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every rial-to-gold conversion locks the contemporaneous market rate in the document so historical reports do not change with current prices."}, {"id": "agents_core_calc", "label": "core-calc", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "C:\\Users\\Sobhan\\OneDrive\\Documents\\gold project prd\\AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pure, tested TypeScript calculations shared identically by browser and server, including the only permitted rounding location."}, {"id": "agents_phase_1_scope", "label": "Phase 1 Scope", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "C:\\Users\\Sobhan\\OneDrive\\Documents\\gold project prd\\AGENTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Phase 1 includes gold jewelry and coin sale/purchase, consumer second-hand purchase, basic inventory and reporting; bullion, silver operations, B2B returns, and other listed capabilities are excluded."}, {"id": "agents_tenant_isolation", "label": "Tenant Isolation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "C:\\Users\\Sobhan\\OneDrive\\Documents\\gold project p